  "flow_summary": "The interviewer was persistent and thorough in gathering information, but the interaction was significantly hampered by a rigid, repetitive, and overly formal questioning style. While the interviewer successfully navigated the patient's confusion, the reliance on repeating full, complex question blocks—rather than simplifying the language—led to a tedious and inefficient interview process.",
