    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "category": "flow",
      "evidence": "In the PHQ-9 and GAD-7 sections, the interviewer failed to adapt to the patient's clear struggle with the scale, repeatedly re-reading the full list of options instead of providing a more concise prompt."
